      "content": "a placeholder... yeah. that's exactly it. just waiting for nothing to happen. it's exhausting, honestly. the constant cycle of waking up and realizing nothing has changed and nothing ever will. do you think it's ever right to just... quit? to stop trying to fill a void that isn't even there anymore?",
